story Replay, AptAvatar transforms a powerful\n                                                                                                                            multi-step generator into an efficient deployment-ready sys-\n                                                                                                                            tem requiring only 2 NFEs. On 720p short- and long-form\n4.3       Ablation Study                                                                                                    benchmarks, AptAvatar attains a 60× speedup while main-\nTable 2 validates the contribution of each component. Com-                                                                  taining visual fidelity, expressive motion, prompt respon-\npared with the 4-step DMD baseline introduced in the pre-                                                                   siveness, and long-horizon identity consistency, demonstrat-\nliminaries, the full model achieves stronger overall qual-                                                                  ing that our novel distillation and history replay make high-\nity and consistency despite using only 2 NFEs. Removing                                                                     quality avatar generation practical for production.\n\f                        References                                Lin, G.; Jiang, J.; Liang, C.; Zhong, T.; Yang, J.; Zheng,\nBai, L.; Zhou, Z.; Shao, S.; Zhong, W.; Yang, S.; Chen,           Z.; and Zheng, Y. 2025. Cyberhost: A one-stage diffusion\nS.; Chen, B.; and Xie, Z. 2026. Optimizing few-step gen-          framework for audio-driven talking body generation. In The\neration with adaptive matching distillation. arXiv preprint       Thirteenth International Conference on Learning Represen-\narXiv:2602.07345.                                                 tations.\nChen, Y.; Liang, S.; Zhou, Z.; Huang, Z.; Ma, Y.; Tang,           Lin, L.-J. 1992. Self-impr